WEBVTT

00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:08.709
[SCOFFS]PO: Oh!

00:00:09.089 --> 00:00:12.048
Nice Dramatic Entrance.
What's the occasion?

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:14.790
Today will be
my final class.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.512
Your final...?
Wait.

00:00:16.526 --> 00:00:18.272
I didn't even know
you were sick!

00:00:18.315 --> 00:00:20.448
Although you have been looking a little...
[SIGHS] I'm not sick.

00:00:20.491 --> 00:00:22.798
...healthy.
A little healthy. A lot, actually.

00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:26.236
[SIGHS] My final class,
because from now on...

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.630
your training will be
in the hands

00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:30.341
of the Dragon Warrior. [ALL GASP]

00:00:32.768 --> 00:00:34.484
What?

00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:37.931
Me, teach? Why not Tigress?

00:00:37.935 --> 00:00:39.422
She's always telling everyone
what to do.

00:00:39.425 --> 00:00:40.491
Be quiet, Po.

00:00:40.514 --> 00:00:41.773
You see what I mean?

00:00:41.817 --> 00:00:43.622
Tigress is not
the Dragon Warrior.

00:00:43.688 --> 00:00:44.820
You are.

00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:46.578
Come on,
they're the Five.

00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:48.303
What could I teach them? [SHIFU SCOFFS]

00:00:48.317 --> 00:00:52.001
There is always something
more to learn, even for a master.

00:00:52.045 --> 00:00:53.307
For instance...

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:55.135
let me show you
another move...

00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:58.008
the Dramatic Exit.

00:00:58.529 --> 00:00:59.835
What's that?

00:01:01.706 --> 00:01:04.407
Wow! Are you kidding me?

00:01:04.796 --> 00:01:07.027
[STAMMERS] Where'd he go?

00:01:07.669 --> 00:01:09.976
ALL: Master. [LAUGHS]

00:01:10.019 --> 00:01:12.108
He's gone, guys.
It's cool.

00:01:12.152 --> 00:01:14.282
We await your
instruction, Master.

00:01:14.306 --> 00:01:17.111
All you have to lose
is our respect.

00:01:20.155 --> 00:01:23.424
I mean, seriously,
how bad can it be?

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.469
Very bad! [GROANS]
Very, very bad!

00:01:25.513 --> 00:01:27.572
Okay, okay.
Let's switch it up.

00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:29.125
Monkey!
Immovable Mountain Stance!

00:01:29.169 --> 00:01:30.518
Yes, Master!

00:01:30.561 --> 00:01:32.085
[GROANING]

00:01:32.128 --> 00:01:33.956
[SIGHS]
Tigress, Tornado Back Flip!

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.044
Yes, Master.

00:01:35.088 --> 00:01:36.785
[GRUNTING]

00:01:36.828 --> 00:01:38.265
Oh, no! Fire!

00:01:38.308 --> 00:01:39.570
Fire! PO: Stop!

00:01:39.614 --> 00:01:41.412
[GROANS]Sorry! My fault.

00:01:41.443 --> 00:01:43.444
Crane, go high.
I mean low! Low!

00:01:43.487 --> 00:01:44.662
[GROANS]

00:01:44.706 --> 00:01:46.229
Ah, my claw thingy!

00:01:46.273 --> 00:01:48.231
Uh, Viper and Tigress, do,

00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:51.278
uh, like, a Totem Pole
Poison Technique!

00:01:51.321 --> 00:01:54.585
Uh, you two,
do a Swarming Insect Bite...

00:01:54.629 --> 00:01:57.762
with a Yellow Tail,
Yellow Jacket, Spicy Tuna...

00:01:57.806 --> 00:02:00.147
[CRASHING]I'm sorry.

00:02:00.635 --> 00:02:02.506
[GROANING]

00:02:04.421 --> 00:02:06.467
Good job, Po.

00:02:08.034 --> 00:02:09.818
Ah!

00:02:09.861 --> 00:02:11.646
Did you at least learn
a little something?

00:02:11.689 --> 00:02:13.039
Yes.

00:02:13.082 --> 00:02:15.128
That you can't teach.

00:02:15.171 --> 00:02:17.725
And Tigress is flammable,
it turns out.

00:02:17.957 --> 00:02:19.306
[PO GASPS]

00:02:24.528 --> 00:02:27.183
GOOSE 1: Yeah, that was
a complete disaster.

00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:28.924
GOOSE 2: Uh, I'm glad
we're not Po right now.

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:30.230
What a loser!

00:02:30.273 --> 00:02:31.840
What was Shifu thinking?

00:02:31.883 --> 00:02:32.972
GOOSE 1:
What was Oogway thinking?

00:02:33.015 --> 00:02:34.408
[GOOSE 1 LAUGHING]

00:02:36.888 --> 00:02:38.847
[WHISPERING]
I think he heard us.

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.067
I didn't hear anything.

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:42.656
Uh, he said
you're a loser.

00:02:55.124 --> 00:02:56.691
I'm sorry, Oogway.

00:02:58.084 --> 00:02:59.302
[GASPING]

00:02:59.346 --> 00:03:00.912
Would you stop doing that?

00:03:00.956 --> 00:03:02.218
How was your
first day teaching?

00:03:02.262 --> 00:03:03.698
Humiliating.

00:03:03.741 --> 00:03:05.134
I heard.

00:03:05.178 --> 00:03:06.918
Who told you?
Did Tigress tell you?

00:03:06.962 --> 00:03:09.138
I heard from Monkey,
and Crane, and Mantis...

00:03:09.182 --> 00:03:11.818
and your dad, and Mrs. Chao
from the gift shop...

00:03:11.842 --> 00:03:13.810
and those ducks
you just passed...

00:03:14.187 --> 00:03:15.666
and Tigress told me.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.713
Did she also tell you that
it'll never happen again?

00:03:17.727 --> 00:03:18.812
Because I'm done.

00:03:18.835 --> 00:03:20.932
Teaching or
being humiliated?

00:03:20.976 --> 00:03:22.559
Both! I don't know
why you ever thought

00:03:22.582 --> 00:03:23.822
I could teach that class.

00:03:23.848 --> 00:03:25.633
Oh, I knew you couldn't.

00:03:25.676 --> 00:03:28.766
What?
You set me up to fail? Why?

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.899
If you only do
what you can do,

00:03:30.942 --> 00:03:34.033
you will never be
more than you are now.

00:03:34.076 --> 00:03:36.426
I don't wanna be more!
I like who I am.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:39.342
You don't even know
who you are.

00:03:39.386 --> 00:03:40.778
What do you...?
Of course I do.

00:03:40.822 --> 00:03:42.954
I'm the Dragon Warrior.

00:03:42.998 --> 00:03:45.506
And what exactly does
that mean, Dragon Warrior?

00:03:47.524 --> 00:03:49.135
Hmm.

00:03:49.178 --> 00:03:52.138
It means, you know,
just going around

00:03:52.181 --> 00:03:53.878
and punching and kicking.

00:03:53.922 --> 00:03:56.359
Defending the Valley!
And stuff.

00:03:56.403 --> 00:03:57.969
Punching and kicking?

00:03:58.013 --> 00:03:59.362
You think that is what

00:03:59.406 --> 00:04:01.779
the great Master Oogway
saw for you?

00:04:02.974 --> 00:04:05.499
A 500-year prophecy
fulfilled

00:04:05.542 --> 00:04:08.415
so you could spend your days
kicking butt...

00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.034
and running through town
high-fiving bunnies?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.767
Yes? No!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.247
[SIGHS]

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.771
Oogway saw greatness
in you, Po.

00:04:16.814 --> 00:04:19.078
Against my better judgment.

00:04:19.121 --> 00:04:22.037
More than you can see
in yourself.

00:04:22.081 --> 00:04:24.083
Incredible power
awaits you.

00:04:26.215 --> 00:04:29.566
Power beyond anything
you can imagine.

00:04:45.408 --> 00:04:47.532
Wow! What was that?

00:04:47.584 --> 00:04:48.846
That was chi.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:49.891
Wow!

00:04:50.761 --> 00:04:52.285
What's chi?

00:04:52.328 --> 00:04:56.941
The energy that flows
through all living things.

00:04:56.985 --> 00:04:58.948
So you're saying
if I teach,

00:04:58.962 --> 00:05:00.336
I'll be able to do
cool stuff like that?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.643
No. I'm saying
if you teach,

00:05:02.686 --> 00:05:04.683
I'll be able to do
cool stuff like that.

00:05:04.697 --> 00:05:05.787
Oh.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:09.215
Mastering chi requires
mastery of self.

00:05:09.258 --> 00:05:11.347
Oogway sat alone
in a cave

00:05:11.391 --> 00:05:14.611
for 30 years
asking one question.

00:05:15.264 --> 00:05:16.570
"Who am I?"

00:05:17.223 --> 00:05:19.138
"Who am I?"

00:05:19.181 --> 00:05:21.052
I'm lucky
if I get five minutes

00:05:21.096 --> 00:05:22.576
before you interrupt... [PO GROANS]

00:05:22.619 --> 00:05:24.905
So now I have to sit alone
in a cave for 30 years?

00:05:24.928 --> 00:05:26.013
Eventually.

00:05:26.017 --> 00:05:27.783
After you master teaching.

00:05:27.787 --> 00:05:31.077
Teaching? There's no way
I'm ever gonna be like you.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:33.195
I'm not trying
to turn you into me.

00:05:33.239 --> 00:05:36.938
I'm trying to turn you
into you.

00:05:39.375 --> 00:05:42.291
Turn me into me?

00:05:42.335 --> 00:05:43.727
Wait a second,
that makes no...

00:05:43.771 --> 00:05:45.061
Almost there, Shifu.

00:05:45.085 --> 00:05:47.775
Just a little more confusing
and you'll be the next Oogway.

00:05:48.428 --> 00:05:50.299
Hmm...Oh! Uh...

00:05:50.343 --> 00:05:52.780
Sorry, no offense,
Master Oogway. I just...

00:05:52.823 --> 00:05:54.347
[INHALES]

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.215
I'll let you get back
to your eternal peace.

00:05:59.308 --> 00:06:00.570
[THUNDER RUMBLING]

